            "review_title": "Review at The Muse - Cocktail & Tapas Bar",
            "review_text": "Alexander H\n8 contributions\n0\nThe perfect bar!\nAug 2023 • Family\nThis place is worth a visit! Not only the location- especially in the evening a great view onto the Saigon skyline- stylish and classy, but above all Xuân and her staff. Absolute Connaisseurs. We enjoyed not only the perfect cocktails but also a deep insight and chat about mixology. Thank you again for marvelous moments at your bar!\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 19, 2023",
