            "review_title": "Review at The Muse - Cocktail & Tapas Bar",
            "review_text": "Augustina\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nA family friendly bar?!\nJul 2022 • Friends\nYesterday after a heavy rain and a long waited taxi we arrived at the place at 20:30. Surprisingly there was no one but a group of families and their kids. Of course it was noisy since children were running around and screaming, then the parents were talking louder than the kids. \nAs it was late and we were hungry so we chose to seat in the corner of the bar facing the entrance but the lady manager refused and guided us somewhere else as the children were playing nearby that corner. So we gave up and left\nIn fact it was a private event but they didn’t put any sign on.\nRead more\nWritten July 18, 2022",
